WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:03.333
We’re directors of
our life. Every morning, 

00:00:03.333 --> 00:00:05.083
you call action.

00:00:12.125 --> 00:00:13.791
If the thing you want 
to do is direct a film,

00:00:13.791 --> 00:00:15.875
well then, child, you’re 
going to see me direct a film.

00:00:15.875 --> 00:00:16.583
Action!

00:00:19.041 --> 00:00:20.666
But if you don’t 
want to direct a film,

00:00:20.666 --> 00:00:22.291
still watch.

00:00:22.291 --> 00:00:23.416
Because there are 

00:00:23.416 --> 00:00:24.500
strategies

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:26.416
that you can 
use in any part

00:00:26.416 --> 00:00:28.708
of your life where
you want to lead.

00:00:30.791 --> 00:00:33.208
As a leader, one of the most powerful
things you can say is “I don’t know.”

00:00:33.208 --> 00:00:34.041
“What do you think?”

00:00:34.041 --> 00:00:35.000
“Teach me how to do this.”

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:36.958
You have to have 
a ton of passion,

00:00:36.958 --> 00:00:37.916
and authenticity,

00:00:37.916 --> 00:00:39.291
so that the people who

00:00:39.291 --> 00:00:40.458
are working with you

00:00:40.458 --> 00:00:41.708
become ambassadors

00:00:41.708 --> 00:00:43.541
for what you want to do.

00:00:43.541 --> 00:00:45.041
They believe it too.

00:00:45.041 --> 00:00:46.291
They feel it too.

00:00:48.541 --> 00:00:49.500
I try to create space

00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:51.583
for the people 
people who are not

00:00:51.583 --> 00:00:53.416
empowered to 
speak in meetings.

00:00:53.416 --> 00:00:54.583
Those quiet people,

00:00:54.583 --> 00:00:56.333
they’re the folks
that have the most

00:00:56.333 --> 00:00:58.625
ability and perspective 
to observe everything.

00:01:03.166 --> 00:01:04.250
The one thing 
that we all have

00:01:04.250 --> 00:01:06.000
in common is we 
want to understand

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:08.166
how to do the 
things that we want to do.

00:01:10.583 --> 00:01:11.708
Look around you.

00:01:11.708 --> 00:01:13.416
You have what 
you need to start.

00:01:14.625 --> 00:01:17.625
I’m Ava DuVernay, 
and this is MasterClass.

